{"availability":"available","full":"timoncool/ACE-Step-Studio","name":"ACE-Step-Studio","description":"Portable AI music generator — full songs with vocals, covers, music videos. One-click install, 100% offline, NVIDIA GPU.","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"TypeScript","stars":377,"forks":54,"created":"2026-04-10T23:34:01Z","updated":"2026-10-06T11:36:54Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://timoncool.github.io/ACE-Step-Studio/","topics":["ace-step","ai-music","gradio","local-ai","lyrics","music-generation","music-video","offline","one-click-install","portable","pytorch","text-to-music","vocals","windows"],"demo":"https://timoncool.github.io/ACE-Step-Studio/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T17:13:26.123Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-06T17:13:26.123Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-06T17:13:26.123Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T17:13:26.123Z","stars":377,"forks":54}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Suno at home: full songs with vocals from ACE-Step 1.5 on your own GPU. One executable — no Python, no Node.js, no launcher.","ACE-Step Studio is a desktop studio for ACE-Step 1.5, the open music model that writes and sings full songs. Describe a sound and write lyrics — or give it a one-line idea — and it plans the song with its language model and renders it with vocals on your own graphics card. Covers, remixes, repaints, a LoRA catalogue, your own LoRA trained on your songs, stems, MIDI, karaoke and video clips, all in one window. Windows installer with auto-update or a portable folder, runs offline on NVIDIA cards from 4 GB of VRAM.","It is built on acestep.cpp, the native C++/GGML port of ACE-Step 1.5. The studio around it is Rust and React in a Tauri window — nothing in the runtime path is Python."],"features":["A player of its own — a ten-band equalizer on Winamp's frequencies with its presets,","Save as, and a Files panel — songs, stems, MIDI, lyric sheets, scores and videos are","A proxy for the whole studio — HTTP, HTTPS, SOCKS5 or SOCKS4, with a login: model","Full songs from a caption and lyrics — up to ten minutes, in the languages ACE-Step","A song from one line — the simple form: an idea in, a finished song out. The writing"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/timoncool/ACE-Step-Studio/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"8c94ee0cf1b7c0fdb814f29da5f7dd8c464dbc52f055b25a21b0f72fb557dfa0","extractedAt":"2026-10-06T17:13:26.358Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T17:13:26.358Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Suno at home: full songs with vocals from ACE-Step 1.5 on your own GPU. One executable — no Python, no Node.js, no launcher.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/timoncool/ACE-Step-Studio/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"A proxy for the whole studio — HTTP, HTTPS, SOCKS5 or SOCKS4, with a login: model","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/timoncool/ACE-Step-Studio/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Activity — a log in the sidebar of every change a connected agent makes and every","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/timoncool/ACE-Step-Studio/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"8c94ee0cf1b7c0fdb814f29da5f7dd8c464dbc52f055b25a21b0f72fb557dfa0","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/timoncool/ACE-Step-Studio/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-06T17:13:26.360Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-06T11:36:54Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/timoncool/ACE-Step-Studio/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-06T17:13:26.363Z","hash":"8c94ee0cf1b7c0fdb814f29da5f7dd8c464dbc52f055b25a21b0f72fb557dfa0","originalBytes":35227,"storedBytes":35227,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["studio","docs","ace-step","one","lora","model","own","cuda","every","processor","song","track","screenshots","songs","agent","card","lyrics","planner","midi","engine","models","mcp","any","dit","samples","set","bf16",